  m_text: 'SCORE AND STARS


    Score

    +100 each delivery

    +50 per object,
    when one placement delivers two or more

    +50 per door, once the object reaches
    a ring on another board

    +75 each unused tile, only if every object is delivered



    Stars

    1st:
    Deliver all objects but one.

    2nd: Deliver every object.

    3rd: Reach
    the target score.


    The level ends when all objects are delivered, no object
    can reach its destination, no tiles remain, or no empty cells remain.'
