      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "BUILD THE PATH\n\nGoal\nGuide each colored object to its matching ring.\n\nPlace
    Tiles\nSelect a tile from the supply, then select an empty cell. Tiles have fixed
    orientations and cannot be moved or rotated.\n\nMovement\nEach placement makes
    unfinished objects follow connected paths. They stop when the path ends.\n\n\u2022
    T and Cross: Choose an exit arrow. Objects cannot reverse direction.\n\u2022
    Bridge: Objects travel straight through the crossing.\n\u2022 Dark cells: Obstacles
    that cannot hold tiles.\n\u2022 Crossed-out objects: Their next step is blocked.\n\nUndo\nUndo
    restores the state before your last placement. It is available until the level
    ends."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
