  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "DOORS AND DWINDLING TILES\n\nLinked Doors\nDoors with matching letters
    connect in both directions. Any object can use them.\n\nGuide an object into
    a door to teleport it to its partner. At an exit between two cells, choose which
    direction the object faces.\n\nTile Loss\nAfter each delivery, when available:\n\u2022
    One random tile is removed from that object\u2019s traveled path.\n\u2022 One
    random unused tile is removed from your supply.\n\nRemoval happens after all
    objects finish moving for that placement. A missing tile leaves a gap you can
    rebuild.\n\nNo tiles are removed when a placement delivers every remaining object.\n\nRecover
    a Tile\nDeliver two or more objects with one placement to earn a combo. If play
    continues, choose one tile from the Removed panel to return to your supply."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
